            "notes": "## Power\n\nYour first power should be [Bingo!](item_1234b16b-1426-4a0c-b6c3-213180336cc6). This allows you to farm abilities off the tank and generate a lot of stadium cash.\n\n## Items\n\n### Required\n\n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)\n\n  - A lot of extra survivability in the first round.\n\n- [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)\n\n  - Increases spam and lets you proc [Bingo!](item_1234b16b-1426-4a0c-b6c3-213180336cc6) more often.\n\n### Optional\n\n- [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)\n\n  - With an [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) focused build and [Bingo!](item_1234b16b-1426-4a0c-b6c3-213180336cc6), this is a good item choice.\n\n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)\n\n  - Not as good, but could still be an option if you prefer.\n\n## Playstyle\n\nUse [Bingo!](item_1234b16b-1426-4a0c-b6c3-213180336cc6) to refresh your abilities off the tank and play at a much higher tempo than the enemy expects. Never give them a moment of peace.",
